 %PARRDR-info: duplication of nonbonded entry HA  
 %PARRDR-info: duplication of nonbonded entry HA  
 %PARRDR-info: duplication of nonbonded entry OC  
 %PARRDR-info: duplication of nonbonded entry C   
 CNSsolve>! read DNA/RNA restraints if needed 
 CNSsolve>if ($Data.dnarest eq true ) then 
 NEXTCD: condition evaluated as true
 CNSsolve>    @RUN:protocols/dna-rna_restraints.cns 
 ASSFIL: file dna-rna_restraints.cns opened.
 CNSsolve>! dna-rna_restraints.cns 
 CNSsolve>!    Automatically define backbone dihedral angles, hbonds and planarity restraints 
 CNSsolve>!    for nucleic acids 
 CNSsolve>! 
 CNSsolve>! *********************************************************************** 
 CNSsolve>! * Copyright 2003-2022 Alexandre Bonvin, Utrecht University.           * 
